infinite-patch 1
# Clavinet D6 Pickup Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 40
  i note1 43
  i note2 47
  i note3 52
  i note4 47
  i note5 43
  i note6 40
  i note7 45
  i note8 48
  i note9 52
  i note10 55
  i note11 52
  i note12 48
  i note13 45
  i note14 43
  i note15 47
  b en0 1
  b en1 1
